    "updated_at": "2026-02-02T21:24:15Z",
    "body": "Not sure if it should be this meeting or a CSSWG breakout, but there are some Form Controls items that were [tagged for the CSSWG F2F](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22Agenda%2B%20F2F%22%20label%3Acss-forms-1) that might be reasonable to take up. Copying over the set and the ordering from F2F agenda planning:\n\nA few hopefully quick to warm up:\n\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13226\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12430\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13124\n\nSome that could benefit from F2F bandwidth:\n\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13355\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13400\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12267\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11873\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12419\n*  https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12963\n\nThese are relatively easy to handle on a telecon:\n\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12225\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11869\n* https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12490",
